      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MANA'S WAY (3) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a 0.9 lengths third (23.12) behind Star Of Venus at this track. Makes plenty of appeal. INGA AMY (8) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (23.83) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 at this track. Form here at the trip sound including 11 wins. The form out of her last race has been franked. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. ALL NET (1) has been hard to follow lately, running sixth (22.81) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Shepparton. Well placed here and should do much better. MORAINE GRACE (2) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to bounce back.",
